[Music]  with a box-office takings of just about  746 million u.s. dollars the first part  of Suicide Squad  stabler ranked in the top 10 of the most  successful films of the year in its year  of release  just behind Deadpool so that a second  part will be released was only a  question of time but after the  relatively unsuccessful spin-off birds  of prey the question now arises to what  extent this will influence the Suicide  Squad in the following video we will try  to give you a short overview about the  current state of the production the cast  and the story so the first question that  comes up is to what extent the cast of  the first movie also matches the sequel  it should be noted that margot robbie  will return is Harley Quinn Jai Courtney  as Captain Boomerang Joel Kinnaman as  Rick flag and Viola Davis as Amanda  Waller also on board are actors Nathan  Fillion Taika Waititi Peter Capaldi and  even wrestler and actor John Cena  therefore the Suicide Squad won't be a  complete reboot as the characters from  the first part do show up but according  to the information available so far they  will only be minimally linked to the  predecessor DC fans who didn't find  Jared Leto's Joker convincing can also  be reassured since Leto will definitely  not return to his role Jared Leto who  had expressed great interest in the role  of Joker will be busy with his role as  Michael Morbius for Marvel for the time  being anyway also Will Smith will not  return in his role as Deadshot the new  characters that will appear in the  Suicide Squad are mainly ratcatcher king  shark polka-dot man and peacemaker red  catcher  aka Altis Flanagan is actually male in  DC Comics but according to rumors he  might be female in the Suicide Squad the  ratcatcher is a highly criminal opponent  of Batman in Gotham City and gets his  name from his former work as an  exterminator the rat catcher special  ability is his communication with small  rodents that can come to help him  furthermore the rat catcher is supposed  to have no scruples when it comes to  using poisonous gases the polka-dot man  is in no way inferior to the red cat  he's also one of the biggest enemies of  Batman his name comes from his  appearance because he has polka dots all  over his body which can turn into  fireballs and other weapons the  peacemaker  aka Christopher Smith is officially as  the name suggests a kind of peace  activist who's extremely pacifist  he loves peace so much so to say that he  would kill for it according to many  rumors John Cena is supposed to take  over this role although neither Cena nor  gems gun have confirmed this at least as  important as the work in front of the  camera is the work behind the camera of  course and no one less than guardians of  the galaxy director James Gunn will take  over the director's chair  the director is currently working for  both Marvel and DC and is supposed to  bring fresh air to the new Suicide Squad  concerning the story there is almost  nothing known at the moment but we allow  ourselves some speculations one of the  theories is that James Gunn plans to let  almost all known faces die on screen at  the beginning of the movie this is  supported by the fact that gun when he  posted the cast on Twitter remarked that  we shouldn't get too attached to the  actors a comment by John Cena who said  that the first 10 minutes of the Suicide  Squad are a film on their own also  speaks for this  moreover the Hollywood Reporter said  that James Gunn's film will be adapted  from John Ostrander and Kim yells 1980s  comics rather than the new 52 version of  David Ayer's predecessor according to  actor Joel Kinnaman the Suicide Squad  will have a great amount of humor he  even went so far as to say that he feels  like he's starring in his first comedy  film the bottom line is that the Suicide  Squad will definitely be different than  the first part in addition a few days  ago various pictures from the set were  circulating on the Internet in these  pictures you can see Harley Quinn and a  blood red dress and moreover you can  also see the characters ratcatcher polka  dot man and most likely king shark who  is wearing a motion capture suit for  digital post-production the Suicide  Squad will be released on August 6 2021  and of course we will keep you updated  on further news as always  [Music]

